  "content": "<h1><strong>Keerdm的僵尸末日必备模组</strong></h1><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_737e5d99-63b4-4dcb-bc66-d0236240fd81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"2\"></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkeerdm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e1176f98-5369-4e03-82b3-c78a7931710c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"138\"></span></a></h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_11a36afe-b55c-474a-ab88-d6a844121e5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"2\"></p><h2><strong>使用说明</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061079/description_e5481172-ddee-46b4-820b-de6c45e7b637.png\"></p><p>（说明中唯一必要的步骤是点击\"自定义\"，然后将世界风格从\"标准\"更改为keerdm_zombie_essentials:testworld。）</p><h3><strong>要获得图库中展示的效果，请选择talluildings预设。&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>请在评论或提问前阅读完整描述！</strong></span></h1><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong>如果您安装了此模组但未遵循说明，请不要在失落之城GitHub上提交问题!!!!!!!!</strong></span></h1><p>这个模组<strong>非常适合</strong>喜欢<strong>僵尸末日整合包</strong>的玩家。它修改了<strong>失落之城</strong>中的建筑，赋予它们<strong>末日废土</strong>的外观。</p><p><strong>欢迎在评论区留下任何建议或问题！(:</strong></p><h2><strong>特色功能：</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>改造后的城市</strong>带来末日生存体验</li>\n<li><strong>废弃的电力线路</strong></li>\n<li>更完善的<strong>小木屋</strong></li>\n<li>增强的<strong>无线电塔</strong></li>\n<li>高速公路上有<strong>废弃车辆</strong></li>\n<li>遍布地图的<strong>风力发电机</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>城市战利品箱中可搜刮到<strong>枪支和弹药</strong><strong>（可选功能）</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>此模组需要：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>沉浸式风化</strong></li>\n<li><strong>失落之城</strong></li>\n<li>可选：<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong>、<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ) 或 Timeless and Classics TAC</strong></li>\n</ul><p>从<strong>v1.1（支持TACZ）</strong>或<strong>v1.2（支持Vic's Point Blank）</strong>开始，<strong>枪支和弹药</strong>将出现在城市战利品箱中，增强沉浸感。</p><h3><strong>v1.4新增内容：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>高速公路现在包含废弃车辆</strong></li>\n<li><strong>新增风力发电机</strong>景观</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>枪械模组支持：</strong></h3><p>v1.2之后的版本将包含两个独立版本：</p><ul>\n<li>支持<strong>Vic's Point Blank</strong>的版本</li>\n<li>支持<strong>Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</strong>的版本</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>兼容性：</strong></h2><table style=\"width:70.516%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">版本</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.18.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.19.2</th>\n<th style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">1.20.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.2</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.3</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:29.3496%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.4</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n<td style=\"width:23.4797%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ✔️</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>版本特性：</strong></h2><table style=\"width:81.5381%;border-width:3px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:65.3728%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>版本</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.0</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.1</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);border-width:3px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:6.32143%;border